<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Transportadora de Gas cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Transportadora de Gas cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said Tuesday it had cut its intermediate-term rating for Argentina's Transportadora de Gas to neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch kept its long-term rating of accumulate for the company.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipt was unchanged at 12-9/16 in New York.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
